{
 "about": "Pew's face map. OUAK's code shows a face by turning 23 objects on and off (its face component, MainGameOujiFace), one face group per motion row. Pew's new style has a piece for each of the 23 slots, named as the slot, plus their aiming eyes. There is no old style, so no Forever cards. The OUAK slots and groups are the same as in Burda's map. All mappings are mine; nobody has seen them in the game.",
